     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,<br><br>I try to get factor scores using this syntax:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">dataset$x1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lavPredict</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;lv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> newdata </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> method </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;regression&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fsm </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>but I get this error messeage:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">`$&lt;-.data.frame`</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">`*tmp*`</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.425735117090319</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  replacement has </span><span style=\"color:#066\">189</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data has </span><span style=\"color:#066\">243</span></div></code></div><br>If I understand correctly I get a vector with less length due to missing values (NA) are absent in the vector. How can I get a vector with NA to add factor scores in my dataset?<br><br>For exampl, <i>factor.scores</i> function from <b>psych</b> package can do it:<br><br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"> MR1<br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.135834513</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.311101414</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.219167230</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\">           NA<br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.199000840</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.373749604</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.950394459</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.389347554</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.561395932</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.413784921</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">11</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.388829417</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">12</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.130747936</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">13</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\">           NA</span></div></code></div><br><br></div>"
